# The image needs only the two Python projects and the lock file. Everything else stays out of
# the build context, so secrets (.env), game history (data/), notebooks and caches never reach it.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!backend/pyproject.toml
!backend/src/
!frontend/pyproject.toml
!frontend/src/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
